  "description": "MindFusion.Reporting provides applications targeting the .NET platform with the ability to create and display various kinds of reports. The component supports complex data-binding scenarios and comes with a built-in scripting engine that allows adding calculated values to the report. Output options include a Windows Forms report viewer component, print and print preview, export to PDF, XLSX, various image formats, and HTML.",
